      "en": "`docker build -t tools-api:1.0 .` builds the image and `docker run` starts it: `-p 8000:8000` maps the port, `--env-file .env` passes the secrets (never baked into the image), `-v` keeps data outside the container (because deleting a container deletes everything inside it), and `-d` runs it in the background. A `.dockerignore` keeps `.venv` and `.env` out of the image."
